  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a foundation for Indochinese Tiger population recovery in Thailand&apos;s Dong Phayayen-Khao Yai Forest Complex</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to, (1) expand community support for the conservation and protection of tigers in Thailands Dong Phayayen-Khao Yai (DPKY) Forest Complex, (2) improve strategic enforcement, training, and investigations capacity in the DPKY Forest Complex, and, (3) enhance wildlife monitoring to augment park managements understanding of the tiger population in the DPKY Forest Complex and other potential tiger landscapes.</narrative>
  </description>
